+ ## Canonical schemas
+ 
+-The model, population and walk `.schema.json` files in `references/` are the **canonical** machine specs. The `gnd` package vendors byte-identical copies at `src/gnd/schema/`; `tests/test_schema_sync.py` asserts byte equality. To change one of them: edit the canonical copy here, then regenerate the vendored copy from it — never the other way around. The two type schemas run the other way: `gnd discover` owns `src/gnd/type-evidence.schema.json` and `src/gnd/type-judgements.schema.json`, and the copies here are read-only, regenerated from those and held byte-identical by the same test.
